Note on the sources
-------------------
This dataset is a compilation of numeric values and structural information
taken from the primary scientific literature. The individual facts and data
points are not themselves subject to copyright; this compilation, its
structure, its curation and its accompanying text are released under CC BY 4.0.
Verbatim text from the source papers has deliberately not been reproduced. For
the wording, figures and tables of any original study, consult that study at
the DOI given in references.csv / references.bib.

The analysis and helper scripts (everything under scripts/) are licensed
separately under the MIT licence; see LICENSE-CODE.
